      "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThese papers give generalizations of the theorem on formal functions\n<REF_0001> (sometimes referred to Grothendieck's Fundamental\nTheorem for proper morphisms) and Grothendieck's Existence\nTheorem <REF_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> Knutson: <EMPHOPEN_0001>Algebraic spaces<EMPHCLOSE_0001> <REF_0003>\n<STRUCT_0004>\nGeneralizes these theorems to algebraic spaces.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006> Abramovich-Vistoli: <EMPHOPEN_0002>Compactifying the space of stable maps<EMPHCLOSE_0002>\n<REF_0004>\n<STRUCT_0007>\nGeneralizes these theorems to tame Deligne-Mumford stacks\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009> Olsson and Starr: <EMPHOPEN_0003>Quot functors for Deligne-Mumford stacks<EMPHCLOSE_0003>\n<REF_0005>\n<STRUCT_0010>\nGeneralizes these theorems to separated Deligne-Mumford stacks.\n<STRUCT_0011>\n<STRUCT_0012> Olsson: <EMPHOPEN_0004>On proper coverings of Artin stacks<EMPHCLOSE_0004>\n<REF_0006>\n<STRUCT_0013>\nProvides a generalization to proper Artin stacks.\n<STRUCT_0014>\n<STRUCT_0015> Conrad: <EMPHOPEN_0005>Formal GAGA on Artin stacks<EMPHCLOSE_0005> <REF_0007>\n<STRUCT_0016>\nProvides a generalization to proper Artin stacks and proves a formal\nGAGA theorem.\n<STRUCT_0017>\n<STRUCT_0018> Olsson: <EMPHOPEN_0006>Sheaves on Artin stacks<EMPHCLOSE_0006> <REF_0008>\n<STRUCT_0019>\nProvides another proof for the generalization to proper Artin stacks.\n<STRUCT_0020>\n<STRUCT_0021>\n\n\n",
